+# Docutils — 项目索引(L1)
+
+> 本文件是项目的语义相入口。架构变更(模块增删、依赖关系变化、技术栈调整)后必须更新本文件。
+
+## 定位
+Docutils turns plaintext documentation (mainly reStructuredText) into useful formats such as HTML, LaTeX, man pages, ODT and XML. Processing is a pipeline coordinated by `docutils.core.Publisher`: a **reader** collects input and calls a **parser** to build a document tree (`docutils.nodes`), **transforms** rewrite the tree (references, front matter, decorations), and a **writer** serializes it. Settings come from command-line options and config files (`docutils.frontend`).
+
+## 技术栈
+Python 3.9+, standard library only (Pygments and other packages are optional). Tests: run `python3 alltests.py` from the `test/` directory (unittest-based; the functional tests find their input and expected files relative to `test/`). Console entry points (`docutils`, `rst2html`, ...) are defined in `docutils/core.py` and `docutils/__main__.py`.
+
+## 目录结构
+```text
+docutils-project/
+├── docutils/                # core package: Publisher API, settings, I/O, document tree → docutils/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   ├── languages/           # language modules for output labels → docutils/languages/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   ├── parsers/             # parser components → docutils/parsers/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   │   └── rst/             # reStructuredText parser, roles, tables → docutils/parsers/rst/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   │       ├── directives/  # directive implementations → docutils/parsers/rst/directives/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   │       └── languages/   # localized directive/role names → docutils/parsers/rst/languages/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   ├── readers/             # readers and their default transforms → docutils/readers/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   ├── transforms/          # tree transforms → docutils/transforms/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   ├── utils/               # shared utilities → docutils/utils/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   │   └── math/            # math converters → docutils/utils/math/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│   └── writers/             # writers and shared HTML base → docutils/writers/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│       ├── html4css1/       # HTML 4 writer → docutils/writers/html4css1/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│       ├── html5_polyglot/  # HTML5 writer → docutils/writers/html5_polyglot/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│       ├── latex2e/         # LaTeX writer → docutils/writers/latex2e/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│       ├── odf_odt/         # ODT writer → docutils/writers/odf_odt/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│       ├── pep_html/        # PEP HTML writer → docutils/writers/pep_html/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│       ├── s5_html/         # S5 slideshow writer → docutils/writers/s5_html/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+│       └── xetex/           # XeLaTeX writer → docutils/writers/xetex/FOLDER_INDEX.md
+├── test/                    # unittest suite mirroring the package layout (not indexed); functional/ holds input and expected output files, data/help/ the expected CLI help texts
+├── docs/                    # user and reference documentation (not indexed)
+└── tools/                   # maintenance and front-end scripts (not indexed)
+```
+
+## 模块依赖关系
+```mermaid
+graph TD
+    core --> frontend
+    core --> io
+    core --> readers
+    core --> writers
+    readers --> parsers
+    readers --> transforms
+    parsers_rst --> statemachine
+    parsers_rst --> nodes
+    parsers_rst --> directives
+    parsers_rst --> roles
+    directives --> parsers_rst_languages
+    transforms --> nodes
+    transforms --> utils
+    transforms --> languages
+    writers --> nodes
+    writers --> languages
+    writers --> utils_math
+    html5_polyglot --> writers_html_base
+    html4css1 --> writers_html_base
+    xetex --> latex2e
+```
+
+## 根目录文件
+| 文件 | 职责 | 关键导出 |
+|------|------|----------|
+| (无) | | |
+
+## 全局约定
+- Components (readers, parsers, writers, transforms) declare their command-line settings in a `settings_spec` and defaults in `settings_defaults`; `frontend` collects them.
+- Problems are reported through `document.reporter` (system messages with levels info/warning/error/severe), not by raising, unless the halt level is reached.
+- Directives and roles are looked up by (localized) name through registries in `parsers/rst/directives/__init__.py` and `parsers/rst/roles.py`.
+- Tests compare pseudo-XML or writer output against expected strings or files; every behaviour change comes with test updates under `test/`.
