+# docutils/ — 模块索引(L2)
+
+> 本文件夹内文件增删、重命名、接口变更时,必须更新本文件。上级索引:[../PROJECT_INDEX.md](../PROJECT_INDEX.md)
+
+## 模块定位
+Core package: public API (core), settings (frontend), I/O, the document tree (nodes) and the generic state machine. Readers, parsers, transforms and writers are subpackages coordinated by core.Publisher.
+
