+# docutils/languages/ — 模块索引(L2)
+
+> 本文件夹内文件增删、重命名、接口变更时,必须更新本文件。上级索引:[../../PROJECT_INDEX.md](../../PROJECT_INDEX.md)
+
+## 模块定位
+Language modules for language-dependent output text (labels such as 'Author', bibliographic field names, author separators). Loaded through get_language(); one module per language tag.
+
+## 文件清单
+| 文件 | 职责 | 关键导出 |
+|------|------|----------|
+| __init__.py | LanguageImporter / get_language(): loads and caches the language module for a language tag, with fallbacks and warnings | TYPE_CHECKING, LanguageImporter |
