--- /dev/null
+++ b/docutils/parsers/FOLDER_INDEX.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# docutils/parsers/ — 模块索引(L2)
+
+> 本文件夹内文件增删、重命名、接口变更时,必须更新本文件。上级索引:[../../PROJECT_INDEX.md](../../PROJECT_INDEX.md)
+
+## 模块定位
+Parser components that turn input text into a document tree; the rst subpackage is the main parser, others are thin wrappers.
+
+## 文件清单
+| 文件 | 职责 | 关键导出 |
+|------|------|----------|
+| __init__.py | Parser base class, parser name aliases and get_parser_class() lookup | TYPE_CHECKING, Parser, PARSER_ALIASES, get_parser_class() |
+| commonmark_wrapper.py | Optional CommonMark parser selection wrapper (delegates to an installed third-party parser) | — |
+| docutils_xml.py | Parser for Docutils XML input: converts XML elements back into document tree nodes | Parser, Unknown, parse_element(), element2node(), append_text() |
+| null.py | Do-nothing parser that produces an empty document | Parser |
