@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# docutils/parsers/rst/ — 模块索引(L2)
+
+> 本文件夹内文件增删、重命名、接口变更时,必须更新本文件。上级索引:[../../../PROJECT_INDEX.md](../../../PROJECT_INDEX.md)
+
+## 模块定位
+reStructuredText parser: Parser/settings, the block-level state machine (states.py), inline markup (Inliner), roles and tables. Directives and language-specific names live in subpackages.
+
+## 文件清单
+| 文件 | 职责 | 关键导出 |
+|------|------|----------|
+| __init__.py | reStructuredText Parser class and its settings_spec (parser command-line options), Directive base class and DirectiveError | Parser, DirectiveError, Directive, convert_directive_function() |
+| roles.py | Interpreted text roles: role registry, generic and custom roles, and the standard roles (pep, rfc, code, math, raw, ...) | DEFAULT_INTERPRETED_ROLE, role(), register_canonical_role(), register_local_role(), set_implicit_options(), register_generic_role(), GenericRole, CustomRole, generic_custom_role(), pep_reference_role(), rfc_reference_role(), raw_role(), code_role(), math_role(), unimplemented_role(), set_classes(), normalized_role_options(), normalize_options() |
+| states.py | Core rST state machine: block-level states (sections, lists, tables, explicit markup, directives) and the Inliner for inline markup and references | TYPE_CHECKING, MarkupError, UnknownInterpretedRoleError, InterpretedRoleNotImplementedError, ParserError, MarkupMismatch, RSTStateMachine, NestedStateMachine, RSTState, build_regexp(), Inliner, Body, RFC2822Body, SpecializedBody, BulletList, DefinitionList, EnumeratedList, FieldList, OptionList, RFC2822List, ExtensionOptions, LineBlock, Explicit, SubstitutionDef, Text, SpecializedText, Definition, Line, QuotedLiteralBlock |
+| tableparser.py | Grid and simple table parsers producing CALS table data structures | TableMarkupError, TableParser, GridTableParser, SimpleTableParser, update_dict_of_lists() |
