+# docutils/parsers/rst/directives/ — 模块索引(L2)
+
+> 本文件夹内文件增删、重命名、接口变更时,必须更新本文件。上级索引:[../../../../PROJECT_INDEX.md](../../../../PROJECT_INDEX.md)
+
+## 模块定位
+Implementations of rST directives grouped by kind; __init__.py maps directive names (incl. localized names) to classes and offers option converters.
+
+## 文件清单
+| 文件 | 职责 | 关键导出 |
+|------|------|----------|
+| __init__.py | Directive registry and lookup (language-aware), plus option conversion/validation helpers used by all directives | TYPE_CHECKING, directive(), register_directive(), flag(), unchanged_required(), unchanged(), path(), uri(), nonnegative_int(), percentage(), CSS3_LENGTH_UNITS, get_measure(), length_or_unitless(), length_or_percentage_or_unitless(), class_option(), unicode_code(), single_char_or_unicode(), single_char_or_whitespace_or_unicode(), positive_int(), positive_int_list(), encoding(), choice(), format_values(), value_or(), parser_name(), column_widths() |
+| admonitions.py | Admonition directives: note, warning, tip, generic admonition, etc. | BaseAdmonition, Admonition, Attention, Caution, Danger, Error, Hint, Important, Note, Tip, Warning |
+| body.py | Body element directives: topic, sidebar, line-block, parsed-literal, code, math, rubric, epigraph, highlights, pull-quote, compound, container | BasePseudoSection, Topic, Sidebar, LineBlock, ParsedLiteral, CodeBlock, MathBlock, Rubric, BlockQuote, Epigraph, Highlights, PullQuote, Compound, Container |
+| html.py | Deprecated placeholder module kept for backwards compatibility | — |
+| images.py | image and figure directives: option handling (align, width, scale, target, figwidth, figclass) and node construction | Image, Figure |
+| misc.py | Miscellaneous directives: include, raw, replace, unicode, class, role, default-role, title, meta, date, test directive | TYPE_CHECKING, adapt_path(), Include, Raw, Replace, Unicode, Class, Role, DefaultRole, Title, MetaBody, Meta, Date, TestDirective |
+| parts.py | Document part directives: contents (table of contents), sectnum, header, footer | Contents, Sectnum, Header, Footer |
+| references.py | target-notes directive | TargetNotes |
+| tables.py | Table directives: table, csv-table, list-table and their option/column-width handling | align(), Table, RSTTable, CSVTable, ListTable |
