+# docutils/readers/ — 模块索引(L2)
+
+> 本文件夹内文件增删、重命名、接口变更时,必须更新本文件。上级索引:[../../PROJECT_INDEX.md](../../PROJECT_INDEX.md)
+
+## 模块定位
+Reader components: collect input, call the parser and declare the default transforms for a document.
+
+## 文件清单
+| 文件 | 职责 | 关键导出 |
+|------|------|----------|
+| __init__.py | Reader base class (input -> parser -> document), default transforms, reader aliases and get_reader_class() | TYPE_CHECKING, Reader, ReReader, get_reader_class() |
+| doctree.py | Reader that reuses an existing document tree instead of parsing source text | Reader |
+| pep.py | PEP reader: RFC 2822 header parsing and PEP-specific transforms | Reader |
+| standalone.py | Standalone file reader: default reader with document title/docinfo options | TYPE_CHECKING, Reader |
