@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# docutils/transforms/ — 模块索引(L2)
+
+> 本文件夹内文件增删、重命名、接口变更时,必须更新本文件。上级索引:[../../PROJECT_INDEX.md](../../PROJECT_INDEX.md)
+
+## 模块定位
+Tree transforms applied after parsing (references, front matter, parts, universal decorations); ordered by priority by the Transformer.
+
+## 文件清单
+| 文件 | 职责 | 关键导出 |
+|------|------|----------|
+| __init__.py | Transform base class and Transformer that applies transforms in priority order | TransformError, Transform, Transformer |
+| components.py | Filter transform that keeps or drops pending content depending on the active components | Filter |
+| frontmatter.py | Front matter transforms: document title/subtitle promotion and bibliographic field lists (DocInfo) | TitlePromoter, DocTitle, SectionSubTitle, DocInfo |
+| misc.py | Miscellaneous transforms: callbacks, class attribute propagation, transition checks | CallBack, ClassAttribute, Transitions |
+| parts.py | Section numbering and table-of-contents generation transforms | SectNum, Contents, ContentsFilter |
+| peps.py | PEP-specific transforms: header table, PEP index, target notes, email masking | Headers, Contents, TargetNotes, PEPZero, PEPZeroSpecial, mask_email() |
+| references.py | Reference resolution: targets, anonymous/indirect/external hyperlinks, footnotes, citations, substitutions, dangling references | SectionIDs, PropagateTargets, AnonymousHyperlinks, IndirectHyperlinks, ExternalTargets, InternalTargets, Footnotes, CircularSubstitutionDefinitionError, Substitutions, TargetNotes, MatchReferences, CitationReferences, ReportDanglingReferences, ReportUnreferencedTargets, DanglingReferences, DanglingReferencesVisitor |
+| universal.py | Transforms applied to every document: decorations (header/footer, generator, datestamp), messages, comment stripping, SmartQuotes, validation | Decorations, ExposeInternals, Messages, FilterMessages, TestMessages, StripComments, StripClassesAndElements, SmartQuotes, Validate |
+| writer_aux.py | Writer helper transforms (e.g. convert specific admonitions to generic ones) | Admonitions |
