+# docutils/utils/ — 模块索引(L2)
+
+> 本文件夹内文件增删、重命名、接口变更时,必须更新本文件。上级索引:[../../PROJECT_INDEX.md](../../PROJECT_INDEX.md)
+
+## 模块定位
+Shared utilities: Reporter/system messages, option parsing helpers, typography (smartquotes, punctuation), code highlighting and URI schemes.
+
+## 文件清单
+| 文件 | 职责 | 关键导出 |
+|------|------|----------|
+| __init__.py | General utilities: Reporter and system messages, option/extension parsing, new_document(), path and encoding helpers | TYPE_CHECKING, SystemMessage, SystemMessagePropagation, Reporter, ExtensionOptionError, BadOptionError, BadOptionDataError, DuplicateOptionError, extract_extension_options(), extract_options(), assemble_option_dict(), NameValueError, extract_name_value(), new_reporter(), new_document(), clean_rcs_keywords(), relative_path(), get_stylesheet_list(), find_file_in_dirs(), get_trim_footnote_ref_space(), get_source_line(), escape2null(), split_escaped_whitespace(), strip_combining_chars(), find_combining_chars(), column_indices(), column_width(), uniq(), normalize_language_tag(), xml_declaration(), DependencyList |
+| _roman_numerals.py | Roman numeral conversion used by enumerated lists | TYPE_CHECKING, OutOfRangeError, InvalidRomanNumeralError, RomanNumeral |
+| _typing.py | Private typing helpers | TYPE_CHECKING |
+| code_analyzer.py | Pygments-based lexer wrapper for code blocks and line numbering | LexerError, Lexer, NumberLines |
+| punctuation_chars.py | Unicode punctuation character classes for inline markup recognition rules | match_chars() |
+| smartquotes.py | SmartyPants-style quote, dash and ellipsis education used by the SmartQuotes transform | smartchars, RegularExpressions, smartyPants(), educate_tokens(), educateQuotes(), educateBackticks(), educateSingleBackticks(), educateDashes(), educateDashesOldSchool(), educateDashesOldSchoolInverted(), educateEllipses(), stupefyEntities(), processEscapes(), tokenize() |
+| urischemes.py | Table of known URI schemes for standalone hyperlink recognition | — |
